# Compiled MCP server bundles. Built on demand with `npm run build:mcp:oauth`;
# they were committed once and never rebuilt, so the checked-in OAuth bundle
# ended up with no get_agent_queue tool at all while its source had one
# (task 979e1325). Guarded by tests/mcp/no-committed-bundles.test.ts.
mcp/astrid-mcp
mcp/astrid-mcp-oauth
mcp/astrid-mcp-oauth-http
